{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:58:31+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "URUZ \"Return of The Er Kishi\"", "steam_appid": 931000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Step into a world of Turkic mythology as Uruz, a young warrior whose home has fallen under attack from the forces of darkness. Fight with melee weapons and a bow, call upon ancestral animal spirits, and develop your abilities as you journey through a land of shamans, monsters and gods.<br><br><strong>URUZ: Return of the Er Kishi</strong> is a single-player 2D action adventure with platforming, character progression, quests and rune puzzles, presented in animated pixel art.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/529afc2e9f045cbdbf417f86e4183353.poster.avif?t=1793601900\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/529afc2e9f045cbdbf417f86e4183353.webm?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/529afc2e9f045cbdbf417f86e4183353.mp4?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight with weapons, movement and spirit powers</h2><br>Take the fight up close with melee attacks and combos, or switch to your bow to strike from a distance. Double-jump across platforms, roll through enemies and use explosive items to add another option to your attacks.<br><br>Defeated creatures provide Nazar, the power used to summon the spirits of your animal ancestors. Choose a spirit power and spend your Nazar to bring it into battle alongside your weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/a60488aaf8b459ea80101cd2a959c396.poster.avif?t=1793601900\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/a60488aaf8b459ea80101cd2a959c396.webm?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/a60488aaf8b459ea80101cd2a959c396.mp4?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop Uruz through three Bitig paths</h2><br>Earn experience, level up and spend Bitig points across the paths of the Wolf, Ram and Deer. Strengthen your attacks, improve your health and armor, or expand the capacity of your item belt. Further upgrades offer abilities such as firing three arrows at once or restoring health through successful melee strikes.<br><br>Collect equipment and useful items, manage what you carry, and buy or sell goods with merchants as you prepare for the journey ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/9bc26b2fc2a126eb63924114e0bd26c6.poster.avif?t=1793601900\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/9bc26b2fc2a126eb63924114e0bd26c6.webm?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/9bc26b2fc2a126eb63924114e0bd26c6.mp4?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/364ce3df74a1bae17652bd092b221204.poster.avif?t=1793601900\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/364ce3df74a1bae17652bd092b221204.webm?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/364ce3df74a1bae17652bd092b221204.mp4?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, help people and solve rune puzzles</h2><br>Travel through forests, caves and settlements, meet their inhabitants and take on quests. Find keys for locked doors and chests, gather items and face the creatures standing in your way.<br><br>Combat is only part of the journey. Examine rune stones, follow their clues and work out the correct combinations to complete their puzzles and claim rewards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 30 minutes of cinematics</h2><br>Experience more than 30 minutes of cinematics following Uruz's journey. These story sequences introduce the people, conflicts and mythological world at the heart of his adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Continue a legend from the Book of Dede Korkut</h2><br>Inspired by the heroic tales of the Oghuz Turks, Uruz's adventure begins after the events of his story in the Book of Dede Korkut. When darkness reaches his oba—the community he calls home—he sets out into a world shaped by the beliefs and folklore of Central Asia.<br><br>Meet shamans, encounter mythological creatures and discover where Uruz's journey leads beyond the original tale.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/3bde7cf5bd4b0cd3bbc1cedaae9e6ffe.poster.avif?t=1793601900\" width=800 height=451 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/3bde7cf5bd4b0cd3bbc1cedaae9e6ffe.webm?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "Step into a world of Turkic mythology as Uruz, a young warrior whose home has fallen under attack from the forces of darkness. Fight with melee weapons and a bow, call upon ancestral animal spirits, and develop your abilities as you journey through a land of shamans, monsters and gods.<br><br><strong>URUZ: Return of the Er Kishi</strong> is a single-player 2D action adventure with platforming, character progression, quests and rune puzzles, presented in animated pixel art.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/529afc2e9f045cbdbf417f86e4183353.poster.avif?t=1793601900\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/529afc2e9f045cbdbf417f86e4183353.webm?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/529afc2e9f045cbdbf417f86e4183353.mp4?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight with weapons, movement and spirit powers</h2><br>Take the fight up close with melee attacks and combos, or switch to your bow to strike from a distance. Double-jump across platforms, roll through enemies and use explosive items to add another option to your attacks.<br><br>Defeated creatures provide Nazar, the power used to summon the spirits of your animal ancestors. Choose a spirit power and spend your Nazar to bring it into battle alongside your weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/a60488aaf8b459ea80101cd2a959c396.poster.avif?t=1793601900\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/a60488aaf8b459ea80101cd2a959c396.webm?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/a60488aaf8b459ea80101cd2a959c396.mp4?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop Uruz through three Bitig paths</h2><br>Earn experience, level up and spend Bitig points across the paths of the Wolf, Ram and Deer. Strengthen your attacks, improve your health and armor, or expand the capacity of your item belt. Further upgrades offer abilities such as firing three arrows at once or restoring health through successful melee strikes.<br><br>Collect equipment and useful items, manage what you carry, and buy or sell goods with merchants as you prepare for the journey ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/9bc26b2fc2a126eb63924114e0bd26c6.poster.avif?t=1793601900\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/9bc26b2fc2a126eb63924114e0bd26c6.webm?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/9bc26b2fc2a126eb63924114e0bd26c6.mp4?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/364ce3df74a1bae17652bd092b221204.poster.avif?t=1793601900\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/364ce3df74a1bae17652bd092b221204.webm?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/364ce3df74a1bae17652bd092b221204.mp4?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, help people and solve rune puzzles</h2><br>Travel through forests, caves and settlements, meet their inhabitants and take on quests. Find keys for locked doors and chests, gather items and face the creatures standing in your way.<br><br>Combat is only part of the journey. Examine rune stones, follow their clues and work out the correct combinations to complete their puzzles and claim rewards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 30 minutes of cinematics</h2><br>Experience more than 30 minutes of cinematics following Uruz's journey. These story sequences introduce the people, conflicts and mythological world at the heart of his adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Continue a legend from the Book of Dede Korkut</h2><br>Inspired by the heroic tales of the Oghuz Turks, Uruz's adventure begins after the events of his story in the Book of Dede Korkut. When darkness reaches his oba—the community he calls home—he sets out into a world shaped by the beliefs and folklore of Central Asia.<br><br>Meet shamans, encounter mythological creatures and discover where Uruz's journey leads beyond the original tale.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/3bde7cf5bd4b0cd3bbc1cedaae9e6ffe.poster.avif?t=1793601900\" width=800 height=451 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/931000/extras/3bde7cf5bd4b0cd3bbc1cedaae9e6ffe.webm?t=1793601900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>", "short_description": "Fight through a world of Turkic myth in this 2D action adventure. Combine melee combat, archery and ancestral spirit powers, develop Uruz through three Bitig skill paths, and explore a pixel-art world of quests, rune puzzles and mythological creatures.", "supported_languages": "Turkish, English, German", "reviews": "“Great pixel art. I loved the way story is presented. Compared to other games of this genre, you can see how much the developers focused on story presentation.”<br>9 – Metacritic<br>"